"full_text": "",
"hint": "Become FAMILIAR with the Village: Berry-track its registers, ripen them, and incorporate. This quest lives on the Arc tab (X → I): accept it there (R on its row), then work Village berries until it reads READY and claim it on that same row — the claim is when the Millwrights teach you the windmill (💨/🔨). Only a word you know can be planted: after the claim, Icon hat (5) R on an empty Village plot offers it, and the gears wake. When a faction's word lives in a land, their board opens there — that is how every country ahead will open.",
